{"id":"n1-097","title":"Noun をもって (~wo motte)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Used to indicate means, methods, or time; 'with', 'by means of', 'at'.","longExplanation":"The をもって grammar is used to express a means or method to achieve something, or to indicate a point in time. It can be translated as 'with' or 'by means of' when indicating means, and 'at' when indicating a point in time.","formation":"Noun + をもって","examples":[{"jp":"彼は誠実さをもって人々に信頼されています。","romaji":"Kare wa seijitsusa wo motte hitobito ni shinrai sarete imasu.","en":"He is trusted by people with his honesty.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"誠実","vocabId":"1381180","reading":"せいじつ"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"もつ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人々","vocabId":"1580650","reading":"ひとびと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"信頼","vocabId":"1359730","reading":"しんらい"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"この賞をもって、彼女の努力が認められました。","romaji":"Kono shou wo motte, kanojo no doryoku ga mitomeraremashita.","en":"With this award, her efforts were recognized.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"賞","vocabId":"1351910","reading":"しょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"もつ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"努力","vocabId":"1445130","reading":"どりょく"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"認め","vocabId":"1611790","reading":"みとめ","baseForm":"認める"},{"surface":"られ","vocabId":null,"baseFor